<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="color-scheme" content="dark">
  <title>EspressDKAI · AI 동향 브리핑</title>
  <meta name="description" content="매일 아침 LLM 개발사 소식과 국내 AI 채용·해커톤·인재육성 소식을 한눈에.">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=IBM+Plex+Sans+KR:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@500;600;700&display=swap">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="static/style.css?v={{ version }}">
</head>
<body>
  <div class="ambient-bg" aria-hidden="true">
    <canvas id="bg-canvas"></canvas>
    <div class="ambient-glow ambient-glow-1"></div>
    <div class="ambient-glow ambient-glow-2"></div>
    <div class="cursor-spotlight" id="cursor-spotlight"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="top">
      <a href="#" class="brand" aria-label="EspressDKAI 홈">
        <div class="brand-text">
          <h1>Espress<span class="brand-accent">DKAI</span></h1>
          <p class="sub" id="today-label">매일 아침, AI 업계 소식을 카드 한 장으로</p>
        </div>
      </a>
      <nav class="jump" aria-label="섹션 바로가기">
        <a href="#section-llm">LLM 개발사</a>
        <a href="#section-hiring">AI 채용·해커톤·인재육성</a>
        <a href="#section-telemetry">파이프라인 지표</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main id="app">
      <noscript><p class="empty">이 페이지는 자바스크립트가 필요합니다. 데이터는 <a href="briefing.json">briefing.json</a>에서 볼 수 있습니다.</p></noscript>
    </main>

    <footer id="run-info" class="foot"></footer>
  </div>

  <div id="detail-modal" class="modal-backdrop" hidden aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <script id="briefing-data" type="application/json">{{ data_json | safe }}</script>
  <script src="static/app.js?v={{ version }}"></script>
</body>
</html>
